      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Changes of a number of functions of beta-receptor complex mechanism have been analyzed by means of the microwave-dielectrometry method on native erythrocytes at various stages of cardiovascular pathology. The control scheme of beta-receptor complex has been analyzed in the adenylate cyclase system and the regions have been extracted which are subjected to an attack of pathological factors of the effect."},
